# Runtime\
_behavior._

{.lede}
The [atlas](/structures) shows _what_ each structure is and the [models](/models) page shows _how_ it converges. These pages cover the runtime behavior shared by every structure: optimism, reconnection, duplicate safety, the ephemeral tier that never touches converged state, and the mesh that lets a document run with no sequencer joined at all.
